# Battery: adds energy storage to its cabled grid ("Battery capacity" tweak). Its charge lives on
# the structure - destroying it loses the stored energy. Spawned origin 1.0 above ground.
Prefab gameBattery
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Cube
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 1 0.7 0.1
		Scale 1
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		ContactEvents true
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 1 1 1
